# Workspace Settings

::summary
The Workspace settings surface (Settings → General) in the shell wrapper: the Settings-root Workspace group rows, General pane (name, icon, URL), the F-14 Plan & billing pane (plan card as a single-tier PricingTable, credits meter as a Chart donut, usage, payment method, invoices, redeem), the danger zone, and the plan-ladder / top-up / delete-workspace modals — referenced by name, no inline copy.
::

