## Danger zone

::::row[icon=file style=danger action=openTransferOwnership href=#]
Transfer ownership
Hand this workspace to another member · confirm by typing the workspace name
::::

::::row[icon=file style=danger action=openDeleteWorkspace href=#]
Delete workspace
30-day grace, then everything is gone · type the workspace name to confirm
::::

:::

::

The plan card is a single-tier PricingTable (the current tier only, `state=current`); the full ladder renders in `modals/plan-ladder.surf`. The credits meter is the Chart donut per the coverage-matrix verdict (Chart donut or Dashboard stat, 72-set). Known mockup-internal inconsistency, NOT resolved here: this plan card reads "Ultra $200/mo" while the plan ladder reads "$99/mo" — flagged for a pricing ruling. G3 pass (WP-N3 08-11): Change plan KEEPS its label — it is a meaning-carrying plan action beside the plan card and no registry glyph says "change plan" unambiguously; the title row itself is circled back + title only. At small width (≤ 767px, R-C ruling 08-10) the shell contract applies unchanged: sidebar behind the generated tab-bar + FAB, the 880px column full-width with edge padding, and the pricing-table plan card, donut chart, forms, and danger rows flow full-width.

## Sheets — defined once, opened from here

- **Plan ladder** — `modals/plan-ladder.surf` (`name=plan-ladder`), via the plan card / Change plan (`openPlanLadder`). Non-current tiers go to the payment processor checkout; changes prorate; credits reset on the monthly anniversary; unused top-ups carry over.
- **Top up + auto-top-up** — `modals/top-up.surf` (`name=top-up`), via the credits row's Top up (`openTopUp`).
- **Delete workspace** — `modals/delete-workspace.surf` (`name=delete-workspace`), via the danger zone row (`openDeleteWorkspace`): typed-name confirmation gates the danger button.
